  "steps": [
    "Fry the sliced onions in the oil until deep golden, then drain and set aside half for garnish.",
    "In the same pot add the ginger garlic paste, green chillies, vegetables, curd, chilli powder, turmeric, biryani masala and half the salt; cook 10 minutes until the vegetables are just tender.",
    "Boil the soaked rice in plenty of water with the bay leaf and the remaining salt until 70 percent cooked, then drain.",
    "Spread half the rice over the vegetables, add half the mint, coriander and fried onion, then repeat with the remaining rice.",
    "Drizzle the ghee and saffron milk over the top, seal the pot with foil or dough and a tight lid.",
    "Cook on the lowest heat for 20 minutes, rest 10 minutes and mix gently before serving with raita."
  ]
